# DNS authentication for the MCP registry generates its signing key in this
# directory. This repository is public: a committed key.pem hands over the
# ability to publish under the tereno.xyz namespace, and rotating it means
# editing DNS. Never relax these two lines.
*.pem
key.pem

node_modules/
*.tgz

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.DS_Store
